      71.76,
      418.8,
      310.55,
      476.87
    ],
    "text": "I here give notice that the government intends to acquire thefollowing land that necessary for a public purpose under Sub-section (i) of Section (7) of land Acquisition Act which wasamended as per the amended Land Acquisition Act No. 28 of1964.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
